* from lessons/module-17/lesson-17.html (build table 1)
* EE_Review corpus. Node 'ground', 'gnd', 'agnd', 'dgnd' all map to 0.
* EE_Review's own solvers skip this one: nonlinear or switched part: S3 (SPDT Switch)
* EE_Review solve-dc: skip: nonlinear or switched part: S3 (SPDT Switch)
* EE_Review solve-op: skip: nonlinear or switched part: S3 (SPDT Switch)
